<!-- SERVICES -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="services-top reveal">
    <div>
      <div class="sec-label" style="color:var(--br);">What We Do</div>
      <h2 class="services-h2">Full-spectrum<br><em>design services.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="services-desc">From the first sketch to the final finish — every service is informed by architectural rigour and interior sensibility working together.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="services-grid reveal">
    <div class="svc-card">
      <div class="svc-num">01</div>
      <div class="svc-icon">🏛️</div>
      <div class="svc-name">Architecture</div>
      <div class="svc-body">Full architectural design from concept to construction drawings — site planning, structural layouts, building permits, and technical documentation.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card">
      <div class="svc-num">02</div>
      <div class="svc-icon">◻️</div>
      <div class="svc-name">Interior Design</div>
      <div class="svc-body">Spatial layout, material palettes, furniture selection, lighting design, and complete finish specifications — from concept to handover.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card">
      <div class="svc-num">03</div>
      <div class="svc-icon">🌿</div>
      <div class="svc-name">Landscape Design</div>
      <div class="svc-body">Outdoor spaces designed with the same rigour as interiors — garden planning, hardscaping, planting schemes, water features, and lighting for courtyards, rooftops, and lawns.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card">
      <div class="svc-num">04</div>
      <div class="svc-icon">🪑</div>
      <div class="svc-name">Furniture Design</div>
      <div class="svc-body">Custom and curated furniture designed to complement your space — bespoke pieces, built-ins, and FF&E sourced locally and internationally to suit your style and budget.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

