  <div class="pf-desc reveal">
    <p>A luxury multi-level salon designed around a single continuous gesture — the organic cloud form flowing across every ceiling, every room. From the blush-toned café to the dramatic washrooms, Mehak Salon is unified by material warmth, gold accents, and deliberate contrast between soft and bold.</p>
