<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq">
  <div class="faq-wrap">
    <div class="faq-top reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="sec-label">Common Questions</div>
        <h2 class="faq-h2">Everything you<br>want to <em>know.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="faq-sub">If your question isn't here, message us on WhatsApp — we reply within a few hours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Do you work outside Islamabad?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes. We have completed projects in Karachi, Lahore, and internationally. For projects outside Islamabad, we work remotely on design and visit site at key stages of construction. Distance has never stopped a project.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span class="faq-q-text">How long does a typical interior design project take?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">A full interior design project typically runs 8–16 weeks from first consultation to handover. Smaller spaces like a single room or salon can be completed in 4–6 weeks. Larger villas or commercial spaces with full construction can take 4–6 months. We give you a realistic timeline at the start — not an optimistic one.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span class="faq-q-text">What is included in the design fee?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Our design fee covers: initial consultation, concept design, floor plans and layout drawings, material and finish specifications, 3D visualisations, furniture selection, and construction documentation. It does not include the cost of materials, furniture, or contractor fees — those are separate and managed transparently.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Can you handle both architecture and interiors for my project?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes — and this is exactly what makes The Fifth Wall different. Most studios separate these disciplines. We handle both under one roof, with one designer responsible for the complete vision. The result is a space where the architecture and the interiors feel like one idea, not two projects stitched together.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span class="faq-q-text">What happens in the first meeting?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">The first meeting is a free 30-minute conversation — on WhatsApp or in person. We discuss your space, your vision, and your budget honestly. At the end you will have a clear idea of what is possible and what the next step looks like. No pitch, no pressure.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Do you provide 3D renders before construction starts?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes. Every project includes photorealistic 3D renders so you can see exactly what the finished space will look like before a single wall is touched. We do not build until you have seen it and approved it. This eliminates surprises and costly changes mid-construction.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


